\v 17 nor¦125841 did I¦125844 head to¦125845 Yerushalem¦125846 to¦125847 \add consult with\add* the¦125848 ambassadors¦125851 there that preceded me¦125850, but¦125852 I¦125853 went¦125853 away¦125853 to¦125854 Arabia¦125855 and¦125856 then later returned¦125858 to¦125859 Damascus¦125860.
