\v 16 but¦126237 we know¦126236 that¦126238 we're not¦126239 saved by following rules,\x + \xo 2:16: \xt Psa 143:2; Rom 3:20.\x* but only by faith¦126248 \nd in¦126250 Yeshua¦126250 the¦126251 messiah¦126251\nd*.\x + \xo 2:16: \xt Rom 3:22.\x* So we've¦126253 believed¦126258 in¦126254 \nd Yeshua¦126256 the¦126255 messiah¦126255\nd* so that¦126259 we¦126260 can be¦126260 made guiltless by¦126261 our faith¦126262 \nd in¦126263 the¦126263 messiah¦126263\nd*, and¦126264 not¦126265 by¦126266 obeying all those rules, because¦126269 none of those rules can ever make any¦126278 person¦126241 guiltless.
